(README.md) Tj
T*
(# Slack LMS Automation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 1. Overview) Tj
T*
(This repository implements a Slack LMS automation host on Google Apps Script and Google Sheets, with shared utilities provided by `LMSLibrary` \(`sheet_db_lib`\). Slack commands, events, and interactivity all enter through one Apps Script endpoint and are dispatched through modular parser/security/router/service layers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 2. Features) Tj
T*
(- Single-ingress Slack webhook host \(`doPost\(e\)`\).) Tj
T*
(- Slash command routing for:) Tj
T*
(  - `/learn`) Tj
T*
(  - `/submit`) Tj
T*
(  - `/progress`) Tj
T*
(  - `/report`) Tj
T*
(  - `/onboard`) Tj
T*
(- Event callback routing for:) Tj
T*
(  - `message.im`) Tj
T*
(  - `app_mention`) Tj
T*
(- Interactivity payload routing.) Tj
T*
(- Runtime data persistence in Google Sheets tables.) Tj
T*
(- Slack API wrapper with retry-friendly error shape.) Tj
T*
(- Installable scheduler jobs for delivery, reminders, and reporting.) Tj
T*
(- Health and retry scaffolds for operations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 3. Architecture Summary) Tj
T*
(High-level flow:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`Slack -> manifest.json endpoint -> code.gs#doPost -> SlackPayloadParser -> SlackSecurity -> SlackRouter -> SlackService + domain services -> SheetDb + SlackApiClient`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Key principle: keep ingress thin and move behavior into modular services.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 4. Repo Structure) Tj
T*
(- `code.gs` \342\200\224 anchor web app entrypoint \(thin host shell\).) Tj
T*
(- `00_WebAppEntry.gs` \342\200\224 dependency and DB bootstrap.) Tj
T*
(- `01`\342\200\223`04` \342\200\224 router/parser/security/dispatch layers.) Tj
T*
(- Domain services \342\200\224 `09_LmsEnrollmentService.gs`, `12_LmsLessonService.gs`, `13_LmsProgressService.gs`, `13a_LmsCompletionService.gs`, `14_LmsReminderService.gs`, `ReportService.gs`.) Tj
T*
(- Integrations/state \342\200\224 `11_SlackApiClient.gs`, `12_SlackBlockKitBuilder.gs`, `13_LearnerProgressStateMachine.gs`.) Tj
T*
(- Ops/support \342\200\224 `14_Scheduler.gs`, `15_SheetsDataSync.gs`, `16_ConfigBootstrap.gs`, `17_HealthMonitor.gs`, `18_RetryResolver.gs`, `19_HostTestHarness.gs`.) Tj
T*
(- `manifest.json` \342\200\224 Slack app manifest.) Tj
T*
(- `sheet_db_lib/` \342\200\224 shared library \(DB/config/audit helpers\).) Tj
T*
(- `md_mirror/`, `pdf_mirror/` \342\200\224 mirrored reference docs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 5. Workflows) Tj
T*
(Supported runtime workflows:) Tj
T*
(- onboarding/enrollment scaffold) Tj
T*
(- `/learn`) Tj
T*
(- `/submit`) Tj
T*
(- `/progress`) Tj
T*
(- interactivity handling scaffold) Tj
T*
(- `message.im` and `app_mention` events) Tj
T*
(- scheduled daily lesson delivery) Tj
T*
(- hourly reminders) Tj
T*
(- weekly reporting) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(See `architecture.md` for the full workflow map.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 6. Tech Stack) Tj
ET
endstream
