T*
(trailer) Tj
T*
(<< /Size 249 /Root 248 0 R >>) Tj
T*
(startxref) Tj
T*
(292424) Tj
T*
(%%EOF) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(architecture.md) Tj
T*
(# Slack LMS Architecture) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 1. System Overview) Tj
T*
(The Slack LMS system is a single-ingress integration where Slack sends all command, interactivity, and event traffic to one Google Apps Script web app endpoint configured in `manifest.json`. The Apps Script host executes a thin orchestration chain:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`Slack -> doPost\(e\) -> SlackPayloadParser -> SlackSecurity -> SlackRouter -> SlackService/domain services -> SheetDb runtime tables + Slack API`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The runtime data store is Google Sheets accessed through the shared `SheetDb` / `LMSLibrary` layer. Core operations are audited to `audit_log`, asynchronous follow-up is represented in `delivery_queue` and `retry_queue`, and scheduled operations are invoked through Apps Script installable triggers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 2. Core Architecture Pattern) Tj
T*
(- **Single ingress:** `code.gs#doPost\(e\)` is the only webhook ingress.) Tj
T*
(- **Thin host shell:** `doPost\(e\)` only coordinates parse/verify/route and error response.) Tj
T*
(- **Registry dispatch:** `03_SlackService.gs` maps slash commands and routes event/interactivity payload types.) Tj
T*
(- **Domain services:** enrollment, lesson, progress, completion, reminder, and report services own business behavior.) Tj
T*
(- **Shared library reuse:** `SheetDb` and `ScriptPropertiesHelper` are reused for DB and configuration helpers.) Tj
T*
(- **Operational modules:** scheduler, retry resolver, health monitor, and test harness are isolated modules.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 3. Runtime Components) Tj
T*
(- **Ingress / host shell**) Tj
T*
(  - `code.gs`: `doGet`, `doPost`, host config/dependency accessors, safe response/log helpers.) Tj
T*
(- **Dependency bootstrap**) Tj
T*
(  - `00_WebAppEntry.gs`: DB schema registration and dependency graph wiring.) Tj
T*
(- **Transport normalization and controls**) Tj
T*
(  - `02_SlackPayloadParser.gs`: request normalization.) Tj
T*
(  - `04_SlackSecurity.gs`: signature/timestamp verification with fallback mode.) Tj
T*
(  - `01_SlackRouter.gs`: route-type dispatch.) Tj
T*
(- **Application dispatch**) Tj
T*
(  - `03_SlackService.gs`: slash/interactivity/event/workflow routing.) Tj
T*
(- **Domain services**) Tj
T*
(  - `09_LmsEnrollmentService.gs`) Tj
T*
(  - `12_LmsLessonService.gs`) Tj
T*
(  - `13_LmsProgressService.gs`) Tj
T*
(  - `13a_LmsCompletionService.gs`) Tj
T*
(  - `14_LmsReminderService.gs`) Tj
T*
(  - `ReportService.gs`) Tj
T*
(- **Integrations and builders**) Tj
T*
(  - `11_SlackApiClient.gs`) Tj
T*
(  - `12_SlackBlockKitBuilder.gs`) Tj
T*
(- **State, jobs, resiliency**) Tj
T*
(  - `13_LearnerProgressStateMachine.gs`) Tj
T*
(  - `14_Scheduler.gs`) Tj
T*
(  - `18_RetryResolver.gs`) Tj
T*
(  - `17_HealthMonitor.gs`) Tj
T*
(- **Configuration and sync/testing helpers**) Tj
T*
(  - `16_ConfigBootstrap.gs`) Tj
T*
(  - `15_SheetsDataSync.gs`) Tj
T*
(  - `19_HostTestHarness.gs`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 4. Workflow Map \(detailed flows\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 4.1 Onboarding) Tj
T*
(- **Trigger:** `/enroll` placeholder command flow \(or service call path\) and explicit enrollment service use.) Tj
T*
(- **Flow steps:**) Tj
T*
(  1. Payload parsed and security checked.) Tj
T*
(  2. Router dispatches to slash handler.) Tj
T*
(  3. `LmsEnrollmentService.enrollLearner` ensures learner + enrollment, queues first lesson, sends welcome DM.) Tj
T*
(- **Data reads/writes:**) Tj
T*
(  - Read `learners`, `enrollment`.) Tj
T*
(  - Write `learners` \(if new\), `enrollment` \(if new\), `delivery_queue`, `audit_log`.) Tj
T*
(- **Slack output:** welcome DM via `openDm` + `postMessage`.) Tj
T*
(- **Failure path:** returns structured `{ ok:false, code, message }`; retry may apply for Slack API failures.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 4.2 `/learn`) Tj
T*
(- **Trigger:** slash command `/learn` from Slack.) Tj
T*
(- **Flow steps:** parse -> verify -> route `slash_command` -> `SlackService.handleSlashCommand` -> `LmsLessonService.handleLesson`.) Tj
T*
(- **Data reads/writes:**) Tj
T*
(  - Read `learners`, `learner_progress`, `lessons`.) Tj
T*
(  - Optional write to `audit_log` through host audit helper.) Tj
T*
(- **Slack output:** ephemeral lesson payload with Block Kit lesson card.) Tj
T*
(- **Failure path:** learner/learn missing returns ephemeral error text.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 4.3 `/submit`) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
265 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 415 0 R >> >> /Contents 266 0 R >>
endobj
266 0 obj
<< /Length 4609 >>
stream
BT
/F1 8 Tf
36 748 Td
9 TL
(- **Trigger:** slash command `/submit <lesson_id>`.) Tj
T*
(- **Flow steps:** parse -> verify -> route -> `LmsCompletionService.handleSubmit`.) Tj
T*
(- **Data reads/writes:**) Tj
T*
(  - Read `learners`, `submission_log`, `learner_progress`.) Tj
T*
(  - Write `submission_log` with idempotency key, update `learner_progress` state, enqueue `delivery_queue` next lesson.) Tj
T*
(  - Write audit via DB audit helper.) Tj
T*
(- **Slack output:** ephemeral submission confirmation.) Tj
T*
(- **Failure path:** missing args/learner/progress returns structured error response.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 4.4 `/progress`) Tj
T*
(- **Trigger:** slash command `/progress`.) Tj
T*
(- **Flow steps:** parse -> verify -> route -> `LmsProgressService.handleProgress`.) Tj
T*
(- **Data reads/writes:**) Tj
T*
(  - Read `learners`, `learner_progress`.) Tj
T*
(  - No required writes \(scaffold\).) Tj
T*
(- **Slack output:** ephemeral progress summary blocks.) Tj
T*
(- **Failure path:** learner not found -> ephemeral error.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 4.5 Interactivity) Tj
T*
(- **Trigger:** Slack interactive payload \(`payload` form field\).) Tj
T*
(- **Flow steps:** parse to `interactivity` -> verify -> route -> `SlackService.handleInteractivity`.) Tj
T*
(- **Data reads/writes:** Verify in code \(current scaffold acknowledges payload type/action/callback\).) Tj
T*
(- **Slack output:** ephemeral acknowledgement or view_submission clear action.) Tj
T*
(- **Failure path:** unsupported interactive payload returns safe fallback response.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 4.6 `message.im`) Tj
T*
(- **Trigger:** Slack Events API `message` with `channel_type=im`.) Tj
T*
(- **Flow steps:** parse JSON -> verify -> route `event_callback` -> `SlackService.handleEventCallback` branch.) Tj
T*
(- **Data reads/writes:** none required in current scaffold \(Verify in code for future enrichment\).) Tj
T*
(- **Slack output:** acknowledgement text payload.) Tj
T*
(- **Failure path:** unsupported event type returns ignored response.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 4.7 `app_mention`) Tj
T*
(- **Trigger:** Slack event `app_mention`.) Tj
T*
(- **Flow steps:** same event flow as above, mention branch in event handler.) Tj
T*
(- **Data reads/writes:** none required in scaffold.) Tj
T*
(- **Slack output:** guidance message to use slash commands.) Tj
T*
(- **Failure path:** event falls back to ignored.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 4.8 Scheduled Delivery) Tj
T*
(- **Trigger:** `runDailyLessonDelivery` installable trigger.) Tj
T*
(- **Flow steps:** lock acquisition -> dependency bootstrap -> `LmsLessonService.deliverPendingLessons`.) Tj
T*
(- **Data reads/writes:**) Tj
T*
(  - Read `delivery_queue`, `learners`.) Tj
T*
(  - Write `delivery_queue` status updates, possibly `learner_progress` state transitions.) Tj
T*
(- **Slack output:** DMs for due lessons.) Tj
T*
(- **Failure path:** lock/contention or Slack failure -> structured error; retry queue can be populated by Slack client.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 4.9 Reminders) Tj
T*
(- **Trigger:** `runHourlyReminderCheck` trigger.) Tj
T*
(- **Flow steps:** lock -> `LmsReminderService.sendOverdueReminders`.) Tj
T*
(- **Data reads/writes:**) Tj
T*
(  - Read `learner_progress` overdue rows, `learners`.) Tj
T*
(  - Optional writes to audit/retry queues.) Tj
T*
(- **Slack output:** reminder DM blocks.) Tj
T*
(- **Failure path:** per-learner failure captured in batch result.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### 4.10 Reporting) Tj
T*
(- **Trigger:** `runWeeklyAdminReport` trigger and optional `/report` command placeholder.) Tj
T*
(- **Flow steps:** dependency bootstrap -> `ReportService` summary methods.) Tj
T*
(- **Data reads/writes:**) Tj
T*
(  - Read `learners`, `enrollment`, `learner_progress`.) Tj
T*
(  - Optional write/audit in future implementation.) Tj
T*
(- **Slack output:** summary blocks for admin contexts.) Tj
T*
(- **Failure path:** returns structured report error result.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
