(### LMSLibrary Reuse) Tj
T*
(- Reused: DB client creation, health checks, script property helpers, table CRUD, transaction/audit utilities.) Tj
T*
(- Local wrappers: host-specific dependency graph, Slack domain service contracts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 7. Security Model) Tj
T*
(- **Primary verification:** Slack signing secret via HMAC-SHA256 over `v0:timestamp:rawBody`.) Tj
T*
(- **Replay protection:** timestamp skew rejection \(>5 minutes\).) Tj
T*
(- **Fallback mode:** verification-token check only when signature headers are unavailable in Apps Script request context and optional token is configured.) Tj
T*
(- **Secret handling:** script properties only; sanitized logging redacts secret/token fields.) Tj
T*
(- **Failure response:** consistent structured denial payloads from `doPost`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 8. Scheduling and Automation) Tj
T*
(- `setupTriggers\(\)` installs daily/hourly/weekly trigger jobs.) Tj
T*
(- Jobs use `LockService` to avoid concurrent overlap.) Tj
T*
(- Daily: pending lesson delivery.) Tj
T*
(- Hourly: overdue reminders.) Tj
T*
(- Weekly: admin summary generation.) Tj
T*
(- Optional: `runHealthCheck\(\)` health snapshot run.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 9. Extensibility) Tj
T*
(- Add new slash commands by extending `_slashRegistry` in `03_SlackService.gs`.) Tj
T*
(- Add event types in `handleEventCallback` without changing ingress flow.) Tj
T*
(- Expand interactivity routing by `action_id`, `callback_id`, or modal type.) Tj
T*
(- Plug in richer retry and dead-letter policies in `18_RetryResolver.gs`.) Tj
T*
(- Promote placeholder next-phases to schema-specific logic in sync and sequencing modules.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 10. Constraints / Verification Points) Tj
T*
(- Apps Script header availability for Slack signature is environment-dependent: **Verify in code/runtime logs**.) Tj
T*
(- Correlation ID standard across all tables not finalized: **Verify in code**.) Tj
T*
(- Lesson ordering/next-lesson rules are placeholders: **Verify in code**.) Tj
T*
(- Interactivity business actions are scaffold-level acknowledgements: **Verify in code**.) Tj
T*
(- Exact authored->runtime lesson sync mapping is pending: **Verify in code**.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
