(deployment.md) Tj
T*
(# Deployment Guide) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 1. Purpose) Tj
T*
(This guide describes how to deploy the Slack LMS Apps Script integration using the current single-endpoint Slack manifest and Google Sheets runtime database.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 2. Deployment Architecture) Tj
T*
(- Slack routes `/learn`, `/submit`, `/progress`, interactivity, `message.im`, and `app_mention` to one Apps Script Web App URL.) Tj
T*
(- Apps Script host \(`code.gs#doPost`\) orchestrates parser -> security -> router -> services.) Tj
T*
(- Runtime persistence is Google Sheets through shared `SheetDb` \(`LMSLibrary`\) helpers.) Tj
T*
(- Triggered jobs run lesson delivery, reminders, and reporting.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 3. Prerequisites) Tj
T*
(- Google Workspace account with Apps Script deployment permissions.) Tj
T*
(- Slack app admin access for command/events/interactivity settings.) Tj
T*
(- Target Google Spreadsheet with edit access for script execution identity.) Tj
T*
(- Repository code synced into Apps Script project.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 4. Required Configuration) Tj
T*
(Set these Script Properties in Apps Script project settings.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Key | Required | Description |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| `SLACK_BOT_TOKEN` | Yes | Bot token used by `SlackApiClient`. |) Tj
T*
(| `SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET` | Yes | Secret for signature verification. |) Tj
T*
(| `SPREADSHEET_ID` | Yes | Runtime spreadsheet ID for SheetDb client. |) Tj
T*
(| `SLACK_VERIFICATION_TOKEN` | Optional | Fallback verification token when headers are unavailable. |) Tj
T*
(| `ADMIN_USER_IDS` | Optional | CSV of admin users for future gated operations. |) Tj
T*
(| `DEFAULT_COURSE_ID` | Optional | Default course assignment fallback. |) Tj
T*
(| `DEFAULT_TRACK` | Optional | Default track assignment fallback. |) Tj
T*
(| `OPS_ALERT_CHANNEL` | Optional | Escalation target for reminders/incidents. |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 5. Google Sheets Setup) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
