(1. Create/select a Google Spreadsheet for runtime data.) Tj
T*
(2. Provide its ID via `SPREADSHEET_ID`.) Tj
T*
(3. Ensure Apps Script execution identity has edit access.) Tj
T*
(4. First execution of host bootstrap will register required runtime tabs:) Tj
T*
(   - `learners`) Tj
T*
(   - `enrollment`) Tj
T*
(   - `lessons`) Tj
T*
(   - `learner_progress`) Tj
T*
(   - `submission_log`) Tj
T*
(   - `delivery_queue`) Tj
T*
(   - `retry_queue`) Tj
T*
(   - `audit_log`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 6. Apps Script Setup) Tj
T*
(1. Open/create Apps Script project.) Tj
T*
(2. Add repository `.gs` files and markdown docs.) Tj
T*
(3. Confirm `code.gs` is present with `doGet` and `doPost`.) Tj
T*
(4. Set Script Properties from Section 4.) Tj
T*
(5. Save project and run a lightweight function \(e.g., `ConfigBootstrap.validate`\) to verify property access.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 7. Slack App Setup) Tj
T*
(Use existing `manifest.json` values:) Tj
T*
(- Slash commands:) Tj
T*
(  - `/learn`) Tj
T*
(  - `/submit`) Tj
T*
(  - `/progress`) Tj
T*
(  - `/report`) Tj
T*
(  - `/onboard`) Tj
T*
(- Events:) Tj
T*
(  - `message.im`) Tj
T*
(  - `app_mention`) Tj
T*
(- Interactivity: enabled.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If using manifest import/update in Slack:) Tj
T*
(1. Open Slack app settings -> App Manifest.) Tj
T*
(2. Paste current `manifest.json` content.) Tj
T*
(3. Save/apply changes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 8. Endpoint Wiring) Tj
T*
(1. Deploy Apps Script as **Web App**.) Tj
T*
(2. Copy deployment URL.) Tj
T*
(3. Ensure Slack manifest command/event/interactivity URLs match this deployment URL.) Tj
T*
(4. Reinstall/update app in workspace when required by Slack.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 9. Trigger Setup) Tj
T*
(After first deploy:) Tj
T*
(1. Run `setupTriggers\(\)` once from Apps Script editor.) Tj
T*
(2. Confirm triggers exist for:) Tj
T*
(   - `runDailyLessonDelivery`) Tj
T*
(   - `runHourlyReminderCheck`) Tj
T*
(   - `runWeeklyAdminReport`) Tj
T*
(3. Verify project timezone matches reporting expectations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 10. Smoke Test Procedure) Tj
T*
(Execute in order:) Tj
T*
(1. **Health check**: run `runHealthCheck\(\)` manually.) Tj
T*
(2. **Slash commands**:) Tj
T*
(   - `/learn`) Tj
T*
(   - `/submit <lesson_id>`) Tj
T*
(   - `/progress`) Tj
T*
(  - `/report`) Tj
T*
(  - `/onboard`) Tj
T*
(3. **Interactivity**: submit a test interactive payload \(or `hostTest_fakeInteractive`\).) Tj
T*
(4. **Events**:) Tj
T*
(   - `hostTest_fakeAppMention`) Tj
T*
(   - `hostTest_fakeMessageIm`) Tj
T*
(5. **Scheduler jobs**:) Tj
T*
(   - run `runDailyLessonDelivery`) Tj
T*
(   - run `runHourlyReminderCheck`) Tj
T*
(6. Confirm writes in `audit_log`, `submission_log`, queue tables.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 11. Troubleshooting) Tj
T*
(- **403/verification errors:** check `SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET`, timestamp skew, and fallback token behavior.) Tj
T*
(- **No sheet writes:** validate `SPREADSHEET_ID` and spreadsheet permissions.) Tj
T*
(- **Slack API failures:** inspect retry queue and `SlackApiClient` error shape.) Tj
T*
(- **Triggers missing:** re-run `setupTriggers\(\)`.) Tj
T*
(- **Interactivity timeout:** keep router+service response path lightweight \(<3s\) and offload heavy work to queue/scheduler.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 12. Production Readiness Checklist) Tj
T*
(- [ ] Required Script Properties set.) Tj
ET
