T*
(1. Create branch and apply minimal patch.) Tj
T*
(2. Run syntax checks and smoke harness functions.) Tj
T*
(3. Deploy to non-production/staging \(if available\).) Tj
T*
(4. Validate slash/event/interactivity flows.) Tj
T*
(5. Promote deployment and monitor `audit_log` + `retry_queue`.) Tj
T*
(6. Roll back to prior deployment version if error rate rises.) Tj
T*
() Tj
