(docs/csv-sheetdb-schema.md) Tj
T*
(# RWR LMS CSV and SheetDb Schema Inventory) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## Section 1 \342\200\224 CSV File Inventory) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### CSV file scan result) Tj
T*
(- No physical `*.csv` files were originally present in the repository; generated header-only CSV artifacts now live under `docs/generated_csv/`.) Tj
T*
(- The codebase is sheet-backed: tab names are registered through `db.schema\(...\)` and materialized through `SheetsGateway.ensureTable\(...\)` / `SpreadsheetApp.getSheetByName\(...\)`.) Tj
T*
(- No `headers.indexOf\(...\)`-driven dynamic CSV parsing was found.) Tj
T*
