(%%EOF) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(runbook.md) Tj
T*
(# Runbook) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 1. System Overview \(Ops View\)) Tj
T*
(### What runs daily) Tj
T*
(- `runDailyLessonDelivery\(\)` delivers queued lessons.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### What runs hourly) Tj
T*
(- `runHourlyReminderCheck\(\)` sends reminders for overdue learners.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### What runs on-demand) Tj
T*
(- Slack ingress via `doPost\(e\)` for slash commands, events, and interactivity.) Tj
T*
(- `runWeeklyAdminReport\(\)` and `runHealthCheck\(\)` can be manually executed.) Tj
T*
(- Host harness functions can be run from script editor for diagnostics.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 2. Daily Operations) Tj
T*
(1. Monitor lesson delivery run result \(`runDailyLessonDelivery`\).) Tj
T*
(2. Check `audit_log` for failed/denied request patterns.) Tj
T*
(3. Verify Slack send success from API result patterns and retry queue growth.) Tj
T*
(4. Review `delivery_queue` for rows stuck in `queued` unexpectedly.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 3. Hourly Operations) Tj
T*
(1. Validate reminder job executed \(`runHourlyReminderCheck`\).) Tj
T*
(2. Check `retry_queue` depth and age distribution.) Tj
T*
(3. Review recent Slack API failures from health/audit entries.) Tj
T*
(4. Confirm no sustained backlog in overdue learner reminders.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 4. Weekly Operations) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
