stream
BT
/F1 8 Tf
36 748 Td
9 TL
(1. Run/validate `runWeeklyAdminReport` output.) Tj
T*
(2. Check cohort progress consistency \(`completed`, `submitted`, `overdue`\).) Tj
T*
(3. Data integrity checks:) Tj
T*
(   - learner records have valid `slackUserId`) Tj
T*
(   - enrollment rows align to learner IDs) Tj
T*
(   - progress rows map to known lessons) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 5. Incident Response Playbooks) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Slack Not Responding) Tj
T*
(1. Verify Apps Script deployment URL is active.) Tj
T*
(2. Confirm Slack app is installed in workspace.) Tj
T*
(3. Check Apps Script executions/logs for incoming requests.) Tj
T*
(4. Re-deploy web app if deployment was revoked or outdated.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Slash Command Fails) Tj
T*
(1. Verify slash command endpoint in Slack app settings.) Tj
T*
(2. Check Script Properties required keys.) Tj
T*
(3. Inspect parser output using host harness slash tests.) Tj
T*
(4. Validate security verification path \(signature or fallback token\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Interactivity Timeout) Tj
T*
(1. Ensure interactivity responses return quickly \(<3s\).) Tj
T*
(2. Check router dispatch for `interactivity` route.) Tj
T*
(3. Verify payload parse and action/callback/type handling.) Tj
T*
(4. Offload heavy logic to queue/scheduler path where needed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Bot Cannot DM User) Tj
T*
(1. Ensure user has interacted with bot / app installed scope is valid.) Tj
T*
(2. Validate `conversations.open` response in `SlackApiClient.openDm`.) Tj
T*
(3. Confirm Slack scopes include required IM/chat permissions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Scheduler Not Running) Tj
T*
(1. Check trigger list in Apps Script project.) Tj
T*
(2. Re-run `setupTriggers\(\)`.) Tj
T*
(3. Verify Apps Script permissions/authorization for trigger owner.) Tj
T*
(4. Confirm lock contention is not blocking recurring jobs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Duplicate Lessons Sent) Tj
T*
(1. Inspect `delivery_queue` and duplicate queued rows.) Tj
T*
(2. Check idempotency strategy for queue insertion and submit keys.) Tj
T*
(3. Verify state transitions in `LearnerProgressStateMachine`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(### Data Not Updating) Tj
T*
(1. Verify runtime sheet tab names exist and are writable.) Tj
T*
(2. Confirm `SPREADSHEET_ID` targets expected sheet.) Tj
T*
(3. Check `SheetDb` client initialization and table schema registration.) Tj
T*
(4. Verify script execution identity has edit access.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 6. Retry and Recovery) Tj
T*
(- Retry policy is centralized in `RetryResolver`.) Tj
T*
(- Retryable Slack/API failures are queued through `scheduleRetry`.) Tj
T*
(- Manual reprocess pattern:) Tj
T*
(  1. Inspect due rows \(`resolveDueRetries`\).) Tj
T*
(  2. Re-run job payload through appropriate service.) Tj
T*
(  3. Update attempts/status via `markAttempt`.) Tj
T*
(- Stuck jobs can be moved to dead-letter status after max attempts.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 7. Manual Overrides) Tj
T*
(- Manually trigger lesson delivery: run `runDailyLessonDelivery\(\)`.) Tj
T*
(- Manually mark lesson complete: update `learner_progress` row carefully \(Verify in code\).) Tj
T*
(- Manually enroll learner: run enrollment service path through command/harness and verify `learners` + `enrollment` rows.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 8. Logs and Observability) Tj
T*
(- **Apps Script execution logs:** ingress and function execution traces.) Tj
T*
(- **`audit_log` table:** structured operations and status metadata.) Tj
T*
(- **Queue tables:** `delivery_queue`, `retry_queue` for asynchronous state visibility.) Tj
T*
(- Request tracing approach:) Tj
T*
(  - correlate by row IDs \(audit/submission/queue IDs\) and timestamps.) Tj
T*
(  - Verify in code if additional correlation key is introduced.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 9. Health Monitoring) Tj
T*
(Check these metrics regularly:) Tj
T*
(- failed Slack API calls) Tj
T*
(- queue backlog \(`delivery_queue`, `retry_queue`\)) Tj
T*
(- overdue learner count) Tj
T*
(- scheduler run success/failure) Tj
T*
(- config validation + SheetDb health snapshot) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Use `runHealthCheck\(\)` / `HealthMonitor.getSnapshot\(\)` for consolidated status.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
