BT
/F1 8 Tf
36 748 Td
9 TL
() Tj
T*
(## 10. Maintenance Tasks) Tj
T*
(- Clean old audit/queue logs based on retention policy.) Tj
T*
(- Rotate secrets in Script Properties:) Tj
T*
(  - `SLACK_BOT_TOKEN`) Tj
T*
(  - `SLACK_SIGNING_SECRET`) Tj
T*
(  - optional fallback token) Tj
T*
(- Re-run trigger setup after ownership/permission changes.) Tj
T*
(- Review optional config defaults \(`DEFAULT_COURSE_ID`, `DEFAULT_TRACK`\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 11. Safe Update Procedure) Tj
T*
(1. Apply minimal scoped change in branch.) Tj
T*
(2. Run syntax checks and host harness smoke tests.) Tj
T*
(3. Deploy new web app version.) Tj
T*
(4. Validate `/learn`, `/submit`, `/progress`, app mention, and interactivity.) Tj
T*
(5. Monitor logs/queues for 30-60 minutes.) Tj
T*
(6. Roll back to prior Apps Script deployment if error rate increases.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 12. Escalation Path) Tj
T*
(When escalating, include:) Tj
T*
(- incident start time + timezone) Tj
T*
(- affected workflow\(s\): slash/event/interactivity/scheduler) Tj
T*
(- sample payload metadata \(redacted\)) Tj
T*
(- relevant audit row IDs and timestamps) Tj
T*
(- retry queue sample rows) Tj
T*
(- recent deployment or config changes) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Notify:) Tj
T*
(- Slack app owner/admin) Tj
T*
(- Apps Script owner) Tj
T*
(- LMS operations owner) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(If ownership is unclear, **Verify in code/repo ownership records**.) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
